  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Consider all possible isomeric ketones, including stereoisomers of MW = 100. All these isomers are independently reacted with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> (NOTE: stereoisomers are also reacted separately). The total number of ketones that give a racemic product(s) is/are",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The general formula of isomeric ketone having molecular mass 100 is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo> </mo><mo>[</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>12</mn><mo> </mo><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>]</mo></math>.</p><p>1] Will not give a racemic mixture on reduction with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math>. </p><p>this  ketone have chiral center will give diastereoisomer.<br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image20-674469e4-632d-4ea2-9ef9-95e2d49da3ed.jpg\"/><br >2] Will give a racemic mixture on reduction with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math><br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image21-3ee84990-b36e-4d0b-85c6-7273f435d482.jpg\"/><br >3] Will give a racemic mixture on reduction with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math><br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image22-62722ee2-3676-4028-91d9-4fbc6ef40215.jpg\"/><br >4] Will give a racemic mixture on reduction with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math><br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image23-7423d78c-2286-4777-96e1-16ea470f57b4.jpg\"/><br/>5] Will give a racemic mixture on reduction with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math><br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image24-89935f23-0b71-43db-a3e8-fc11be77868c.jpg\"/><br >6] Will give a racemic mixture on reduction with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math><br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image25-ef997d6d-f915-4648-b4d2-39ea3b8a87a1.jpg\"/></p>",
